  "notes": "{緩|ゆる}む means for something tight or tense to become loose or relaxed, either physically or figuratively.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{緩|ゆる}める→緩める：15263_yurumeru⟧ (transitive — to loosen something)\n- Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{緩|ゆる}む\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{緩|ゆる}んで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates a current state of being loose: ⟦ねじ→ねじ：00307_neji⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{緩|ゆる}んで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (the screw is loose).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦ねじ→ねじ：00307_neji⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{緩|ゆる}む: a screw becomes loose\n- ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{緩|ゆる}む: to let one's guard down\n- ⟦{規制|きせい}→規制：02598_kisei⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{緩|ゆる}む: regulations are relaxed\n- ⟦{表情|ひょうじょう}→表情：03585_hyoujou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{緩|ゆる}む: one's expression softens\n- ⟦{寒|さむ}さ→寒さ：12336_samusa⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{緩|ゆる}む: the cold eases up\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{緩|ゆる}める→緩める：15263_yurumeru⟧: to loosen (transitive)\n- ⟦{緩|ゆる}い→緩い：00430_yurui⟧: loose, slack, lax (adjective)",
